#: ../../engines.md:17 4fc5ecc3b7b849cb962a72ac804e4f5e
msgid "Fourier is in the schema; the models it exists for (Heston, Bates) are not built, so it is never offered."
msgstr "傅立葉法存在於結構描述中；它所服務的模型（Heston、Bates）沒有實作，因此從不提供。"

#: ../../engines.md:20 e36577f6eca042d08350dfde43a00839
msgid "American approximations"
msgstr "美式近似法"

#: ../../engines.md:22 2114af2d3874469099fd5f82e92c0d99
msgid "QuantLib has three closed-form American approximations and **they disagree in the third decimal**, so the client names one rather than inheriting a default. Omitting it is an error on the approximation field, not a silent choice."
msgstr "QuantLib 有三種封閉解的美式近似法，而**它們在小數第三位就不一致**，所以由用戶端指名一種，而不是繼承某個預設值。省略它會在近似法欄位上得到錯誤，而不是一個安靜的選擇。"

#: ../../engines.md e681f2414ba744678f0fa4ef0a1e0dfc
msgid "Approximation"
msgstr "近似法"

#: ../../engines.md 085aef32ee634070a9e1c696643def5f
msgid "Character"
msgstr "特性"

#: ../../engines.md 5001adaf03f748f985ed9f6e5a0da0de
msgid "Barone-Adesi-Whaley"
msgstr "Barone-Adesi-Whaley"

#: ../../engines.md eb0da87b06434c91aab750c4719e1595
msgid "The classic quadratic approximation; fast, least accurate near the boundary"
msgstr "經典的二次近似；快，但在邊界附近最不準"

#: ../../engines.md f4966c192dbf4a97a65df9936c39476e
msgid "Bjerksund-Stensland"
msgstr "Bjerksund-Stensland"

#: ../../engines.md 190cc56acbbe4d0583f5733ccb9be69b
msgid "Flat-boundary approximation; generally the better of the two originals"
msgstr "平坦邊界近似；一般而言是兩個原始方法中較好的一個"

#: ../../engines.md 12b929cf7df14bea9116f6abec4f42ff
msgid "Ju-Zhong quadratic"
msgstr "Ju-Zhong 二次法"

#: ../../engines.md 798106b030414082a8bb43188915fd3c
msgid "A correction to the quadratic method, usually closest to a fine lattice"
msgstr "對二次法的修正，通常最接近細格點的結果"

#: ../../engines.md:32 3bd834035b514b3ea97e52db5e206df8
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The mathematics is in {doc}`maths/american`. If you need a number you can defend rather than a fast one, price the same trade on a lattice with several thousand steps and compare."
msgstr "數學原理見 {doc}`maths/american`。若你要的是一個站得住腳的數字而不是一個快的數字，就用幾千步的格點為同一筆交易計價再比對。"

#: ../../engines.md:36 263740d65cd54cc4b95123363da825f0
msgid "Lattice trees"
msgstr "格點樹"

#: ../../engines.md:38 94ec5b283c89488c849db64bb2199b6f
msgid "Seven trees compile for a vanilla: Cox-Ross-Rubinstein, Jarrow-Rudd, additive equiprobabilities, Trigeorgis, Tian, Leisen-Reimer and Joshi4. A **barrier takes Cox-Ross-Rubinstein only.**"
msgstr "一般型有七種樹可編譯使用：Cox-Ross-Rubinstein、Jarrow-Rudd、加法等機率、Trigeorgis、Tian、Leisen-Reimer 與 Joshi4。**障礙僅支援 Cox-Ross-Rubinstein。**"

#: ../../engines.md:42 1fbbc7de732a4515a9715552885b17bc
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Two of them — Leisen-Reimer and Joshi4 — are strike-aware and force an odd number of steps, which is what makes their convergence smooth rather than oscillating. If you are stepping the step count to watch a price settle, those two settle first. Again, {doc}`maths/american` has the parameterisations."
msgstr "其中兩種——Leisen-Reimer 與 Joshi4——會參考履約價並強制使用奇數步數，這正是它們收斂平滑而不震盪的原因。若你在逐步加大步數觀察價格穩定下來，這兩種最先穩定。同樣地，{doc}`maths/american` 有各自的參數化。"

#: ../../engines.md:47 580da84be4314370aafba02d96ab4456
msgid "Finite difference"
msgstr "有限差分"

#: ../../engines.md:49 bc9dab2be57d4ccd886ad0161e7bc02b
msgid "The grid is **time steps × asset steps**:"
msgstr "網格是**時間步數 × 資產步數**："

#: ../../engines.md 89bb1ed733644aacb39c39f4561ebce0
msgid "Preset"
msgstr "預設網格"

#: ../../engines.md 984da46cc4fd41d9bfa1d81bc7ea7f9b
msgid "Grid"
msgstr "網格"

#: ../../engines.md a515ba0d18174be0ac2c7c8f4be3675d
msgid "coarse"
msgstr "粗（coarse）"

#: ../../engines.md aad048775376497fa17c6dc16f2c84c6
msgid "100 × 100"
msgstr ""

#: ../../engines.md b140c98d1991404b95860d000ce2e2b2
msgid "standard"
msgstr "標準（standard）"

#: ../../engines.md cb3f6ac2e22d48cbbc027b2665df9400
msgid "400 × 200"
msgstr ""

#: ../../engines.md 5251316bb5c0470b93762ffb4b78e8e7
msgid "fine"
msgstr "細（fine）"

#: ../../engines.md e1a5347abb9b47b8a4e097c0c47f1d9c
msgid "2000 × 800"
msgstr ""

#: ../../engines.md:57 4d3007f2d891412e84d33c913e895dae
msgid "A custom grid names both dimensions explicitly, plus the **scheme** and the **damping steps**. None of the four has a default: two grids, or two schemes, are two different prices for the same trade, so a request that leaves one out is refused rather than answered on a choice nobody made. The three presets are Douglas with no damping."
msgstr "自訂網格要明確指定兩個維度，外加**時間離散格式（scheme）**與**阻尼步數**。這四者都沒有預設值：兩組網格、或兩種格式，對同一筆交易就是兩個不同的價格，因此少填一項的請求會被拒絕，而不是拿一個沒人做過的選擇去回答。三個預設網格都是 Douglas 且不加阻尼。"

#: ../../engines.md:63 76d24d8f94934594af40c5ec3bba9850
msgid "The schemes"
msgstr "各種時間離散格式"

#: ../../engines.md 3e9dc41802b646fca36609cedcf680fb
msgid "Scheme"
msgstr "格式"

#: ../../engines.md b46716de981449f19c3658b29180502c
msgid "What it is here"
msgstr "在這裡是什麼"

#: ../../engines.md 02d56be152614b119ad4c20889e7fcab
msgid "Douglas"
msgstr "Douglas"

#: ../../engines.md 2d2fc94616d844a4828b872c1ce3aea7
msgid "QuantLib's own default, second order. What to pick with no opinion"
msgstr "QuantLib 自己的預設值，二階。沒有特別意見時就挑它"

#: ../../engines.md 2b48fce366fe4a15af72a746ba1a9e1f
msgid "Crank-Nicolson"
msgstr "Crank-Nicolson"

#: ../../engines.md 6fc977be13d540cbb6819992b4b16835
msgid "Douglas to within a bit — in one dimension they coincide"
msgstr "與 Douglas 只差一個位元——在一維中兩者重合"

#: ../../engines.md efe34e8428c0483f9f9ffbeacf412b41
msgid "Craig-Sneyd"
msgstr "Craig-Sneyd"

#: ../../engines.md e61865957c4c451d8f546793ecfeadc4
msgid "*Exactly* Douglas here: it alternates directions and there is one"
msgstr "在這裡*完全等於* Douglas：它輪流處理各個方向，而這裡只有一個方向"

#: ../../engines.md 392d43bb9d2e4aa381d2b99644c3ed4d
msgid "Hundsdorfer"
msgstr "Hundsdorfer"

#: ../../engines.md 528b316edbdd4d4a8720218c7a40133d
msgid "A different weighting; differs from Douglas in the seventh digit"
msgstr "權重不同；與 Douglas 在第七位數字才有差異"

#: ../../engines.md f88f4cd1cdf749359acec4a87434d010
msgid "implicit Euler"
msgstr "隱式 Euler"

#: ../../engines.md 0e1bd7b66a3a48ae854ff37a0b264118
msgid "First order, unconditionally stable; differs in the third digit"
msgstr "一階，無條件穩定；在第三位數字就有差異"

#: ../../engines.md bd16f91768cb4b0b98e24e18ea729afe
msgid "explicit Euler"
msgstr "顯式 Euler"

#: ../../engines.md 0bdb1c136256496a9a076ea53a200ef8
msgid "Closed — see below"
msgstr "已關閉——見下文"

#: ../../engines.md:74 c3c910c68b784558aee9b84eb9ad2771
msgid "Explicit Euler is refused, and the reason is worth knowing rather than working around: it is stable only while the time step is small against the *square* of the asset step, and the asset step belongs to a grid QuantLib builds inside the engine rather than to anything you can see on this panel. An unstable run does not fail — measured on this build, a half-year vanilla at 100 × 200 came back as 2.4e140 and at 400 × 200 as a NaN. Implicit Euler is first order too, with no such condition."
msgstr "顯式 Euler 被拒絕，而它的理由值得知道，而不是繞過去：它只有在時間步長相對於資產步長的*平方*夠小時才穩定，而資產步長屬於 QuantLib 在引擎內部自行建構的網格，不屬於這個面板上你看得到的任何東西。不穩定的計算不會失敗——在這個版本上實測，半年期一般型在 100 × 200 回來的是 2.4e140，在 400 × 200 回來的是 NaN。隱式 Euler 同樣是一階，卻沒有這個條件。"

#: ../../engines.md:82 b0ea33e71e3d4a24a4a7e2ae994342e5
msgid "Damping steps"
msgstr "阻尼步數"

#: ../../engines.md:84 6529414a3403437aa07c07efda0cc597
msgid "Rannacher damping takes the first few time steps fully implicit, which kills the oscillation a Crank-Nicolson-family scheme shows against a kinked payoff or a barrier. They come **out of** the time steps rather than being added to them, so asking for at least as many damping steps as time steps is refused."
msgstr "Rannacher 阻尼把最前面幾個時間步改成全隱式，藉此消除 Crank-Nicolson 家族格式在收益函數轉折處或障礙附近出現的震盪。它們是**從**時間步數裡撥出來的，不是外加的，因此要求的阻尼步數若不少於時間步數，會被拒絕。"

#: ../../engines.md:89 3ef73f6db4b1447c9e58d9f30a4d69df
msgid "Reach for them when a price wobbles as you step the grid — particularly on a barrier, and particularly near the barrier."
msgstr "當你調整網格而價格上下擺盪時就該動用它——尤其是障礙商品，尤其是在障礙附近。"

#: ../../engines.md:92 2be308cd42ce4dd0aecfdadaa8521ed0
msgid "Under quanto the grid must be one of the three presets. The wrapper builds its inner engine from a process alone, so each grid is a separate compiled type and an arbitrary pair has nowhere to go. It is refused loudly rather than rounded to the nearest preset."
msgstr "在 quanto 之下，網格必須是三個預設之一。包裝器只用一個隨機過程建構內層引擎，因此每一組網格都是一個獨立編譯出來的型別，任意的一對尺寸無處可去。它會被明確拒絕，而不是四捨五入到最接近的預設網格。"

#: ../../engines.md:97 60a6f5d7fbdc4b4c8e201586a45c1a27
msgid "Monte Carlo"
msgstr "蒙地卡羅"

#: ../../engines.md:99 cd348204b5674300a8a738a1e703c0d9
msgid "**The seed must be non-zero.** QuantLib otherwise seeds from the clock, and the same inputs would price differently on every request."
msgstr "**亂數種子不得為零。**否則 QuantLib 會以時鐘取種，同樣的輸入在每次請求都會算出不同的價格。"

#: ../../engines.md:101 c5c402dd5a9e443ba9f04eee0722373b
msgid "Give **samples**; this build requires a positive sample count and does not serve the absolute-tolerance form the schema carries."
msgstr "請給**樣本數**；這個版本要求正的樣本數，並未提供結構描述中另一種以絕對誤差為準的形式。"

#: ../../engines.md:103 29963065a2a94593aaa65f429dba8147
msgid "**Steps per year** matters for anything path-dependent (a barrier, an Asian, a cliquet); a European payoff only needs the terminal value."
msgstr "**每年步數**對任何路徑相依的商品都重要（障礙、亞式、棘輪式）；歐式收益函數只需要期末值。"

#: ../../engines.md:105 5bb21f37c399413eacc34d5558bdaeba
msgid "Monte Carlo is not offered for every style, and where it is closed the control says why. A cliquet is the sharpest case: QuantLib's only sampled cliquet engine prices the **performance** form, so the ratchet takes analytic and nothing else."
msgstr "並不是每一種類型都提供蒙地卡羅，關掉的地方控制項會說明原因。棘輪式是最明顯的例子：QuantLib 唯一的抽樣型棘輪引擎算的是**表現型**，所以棘輪型只能走解析解，別無其他。"

#: ../../engines.md:109 a62e750e4f384f7ea3b022956806f240
msgid "Setting **progress every N paths** switches to the batched path. That is what emits progress frames, what draws the convergence trace, and what lets a cancel stop the work rather than only the waiting."
msgstr "設定**每 N 條路徑回報進度**會切換到分批路徑。那正是送出進度訊框、畫出收斂軌跡，並讓取消真正停下工作而不只是停下等待的東西。"

#: ../../engines.md:113 ecc2c1135c0a433da435412790f767ba
msgid "Batching **changes the answer**, because independent batches with derived seeds draw from the random number stream differently from one run of the same total. Measured on the reference trade: 9.288545 single-shot against 9.307731 batched, same seed and same sample count, with the analytic value at 9.297476. Neither is wrong; they are different estimators. Reproducibility keys on the triple (seed, samples, batch size), which is why the result echoes the whole engine block back."
msgstr "分批**會改變答案**，因為以衍生種子跑的各批次，從亂數流中取值的方式與同樣總量的一次跑並不相同。在基準交易上實測：單次 9.288545 對分批 9.307731，相同的種子與樣本數，而解析解值為 9.297476。兩者都不錯；它們是不同的估計量。可重現性繫於（種子、樣本數、批次大小）這個三元組，這也是結果會把整個引擎區塊回音報出的原因。"

